		)
		(uuid "33e7dafb-055c-488c-9f64-622718a194c3")
	)
	(text "U?: ADS1118IDGSR (LCSC C55347, ~$1.75 @10). Replaces MCP96L00 (I2C, locked up until power-cycled).\n\nAIN0/AIN1 = TC0P/TC0N    AIN2/AIN3 = TC1P/TC1N\nSCLK = SPI_SCK   DIN = SPI_MOSI   CS = TC_ADC_CS (10k pull-up to +3.3V)\nDOUT/DRDY = SPI_MISO (22R at the pin; DRDY is muxed on DOUT, no extra GPIO)\nVDD = +3.3V with 0.1 uF + 1 uF to GND.  GND = GND.\n\nSettings: PGA +/-0.256 V, 128 SPS, alternate TC0 / TC1 / internal temp sensor.\nInternal temp sensor = cold junction (and board temp for the CAN status msg).\nPlace U? close to the TC connectors and on the same copper so the\ncold-junction reading matches the connector temperature.\n\nSPI mode 1 (CPOL 0, CPHA 1). Shares SPI1 with nothing else on this board."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 105.41 26.669999999999998 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "4716ac33-2fc1-47f4-bf45-fcb7903e9d7f")
	)
	(text "Test Points"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 205.74 22.86 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "d391bf9f-ce6f-44eb-abe9-23f9ec5d9cb0")
	)
	(rectangle
